{{> header title="You have been added to a team" }}

<p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>

<p>You have been added to <strong>{{businessName}}</strong> on Qlozet as a
    <strong>{{role}}</strong>.</p>

<p>You already have a Qlozet account, so there is no new password — sign in with
    the one you have and switch to {{businessName}} from the account menu.</p>

{{> button url=loginUrl text="Sign in" }}

<p class="muted">Forgotten your password? Use "Forgot password" on the sign-in page.</p>
